## Why This Is Asked
This probes advanced multi-tenant isolation, key management, and end-to-end dataflow across regions.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant isolation (datasets/buckets)
- CMEK and IAM Conditions
- Dataflow templates and idempotent loads
- Data Catalog lineage
- Cross-region DR and testing

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo Dataflow idempotent write guard
function process(element, seenLoadIds) {
  const loadId = element.source_file_checksum;
  if (seenLoadIds.has(loadId)) return;
  // writeToBigQuery(element) would occur here
  seenLoadIds.add(loadId);
}
```

